title: mf repo known
tags: [[CLI command]] Daemon
kind: reference
summary: List the repositories the daemon's configuration knows by name, loaded or not (pretty-printed JSON)

Prints [[GET /repos/known]]: every repository the daemon's `config.toml` names in
`[[known]]` or `[[load]]`, with whether it is loaded, and why it could not be read
when it could not. `mf -n NAME repo load` loads one of them by its name
([[Known repositories]]).
